(text "PROTOTYPE ONLY: added F101,U101..103,R101..105,C101..104,C202. Existing charger shown completely; parent integration pending." (at 20.32 320.04 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid "04933883-fcfc-5d96-886e-191a516fbe97"))
(text "F101 first at cell positive tab BEFORE ALL charger/boost branches. Cell tab-to-fuse conductor must be short, insulated and mechanically restrained." (at 20.32 324.54 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid "552600ea-a10f-5027-ab12-c4fd84a693c2"))
(text "U103 interrupts BQ input, including BQ IN-OUT short; not a cell-discharge switch. U101 senses actual cell tab independently of BQ feedback." (at 20.32 329.04 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid "dacf7dfa-fbd4-5fa8-8272-1b94ebb7ff3a"))
(text "U102 holds ON low during monitor startup/brownout. OV fault opens U103; hysteretic retry, not a latched OVP. No firmware dependency." (at 20.32 333.54 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid "e9baf712-f074-5636-be11-6ead3e8506d4"))
(text "PROPOSED charger tuning2.576V, same25mA: top22.2k/bottom10k both0.1%10ppm. No sibling edits. Healthy overshoot5mV allocation requires bench proof." (at 20.32 338.04 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid "6a20b662-dfbb-5b85-9d94-e6a3511b4fb7"))
(text "Fault-turnoff max absent; fuse I2t/resistance nominal only. Decaying fault clearing/temperature/voltage overshoot UNMET. Not all-single-fault safe." (at 20.32 342.54 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid "d17d6edf-a923-5fa4-b9e8-b83201cda88b"))
(text "Boundaries are external circuits/cell assembly, not invented physical connector pads. No layout fit or manufacturing-release claim." (at 20.32 347.04 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid "92721a16-ed58-58fd-b7fc-4521905159c7"))
